      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a major issue that needs to be addressed. Timeouts or disconnections should always result in you being returned to the instance you were in when the connection issue happened, not your home world. As a Starlink user, this happens a lot due to the nature of the connection.\n\nAlso, the timeout/disconnected box has a tendency to spawn in random locations, sometimes even behind the user where it can't easily be seen.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
