  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-05-31T14:39:46.230Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After getting Timed out error I being sent to Home instance instead of instance I been before disconnection happened. Also, sometimes, after reconnection I stopping receiving invites from other people. (websockets not reconnecting properly sometimes?)\n\n1. Simulate Internet connection interruption to get the window \"Disconnected. Your connection to VRChat timed out. Verify connection and try again.\"\n\n2. Restore Internet connection then press Retry button.\n\n3. You will be send to Home instance instead of instance you been before disconnection.",
